com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyJO-CVP5YTOuxNCZpygfSz2N_ZflolXsmCVmWjOJ1dlg&oe=69B54FCD"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 1.png", "id": "1021011425999827", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_1021011429333160_4176289926510597494_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_YnnNKgQ8bwQ7kNvwESKqJH&_nc_oc=Adn4CeIMSnCDlZRaomOYsnp5NifPSnWggB2NoFANM-jfcGpZAijwQooSP4zy3DPfej0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz7k4FEn6bfk58jy9bwBus5UvLaxnglRpYNcHlN1slB1w&oe=69B54561"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 4.png", "id": "524012790104112", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001669_524012793437445_4891316513078544414_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BUoIvckLLSMQ7kNvwHMnnnD&_nc_oc=AdlmV8T5vRUp0BN679ZQV8OCZjAfLj_J0rREL7X_aMZ-BHxXICzpSf5E8aOsXR4r1qg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfykbJv2l10XQ0fcSia64cBvjkGGkMiPN-B2xJZY8JuY5w&oe=69B559DA"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 3.png", "id": "1187574142495669", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031470_1187574145829002_8495108821353233334_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-nuCngSdUSUQ7kNvwEW5O-r&_nc_oc=AdkvkwkzSTJqBftxpR8PzzN4RLD0yr9siqinnxj8vn7Hks6LcUWINXGgoz67aZnj9-o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxxEXuydp1VtQUFFfbGLja5YJg0ml4j836Z8i3eMsOKiQ&oe=69B54C70"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38974450_2251639131854765_8396477208328520911_n.png", "id": "529809686395654", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476759_529809689728987_2021663405477506286_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ak22DcfRHPwQ7kNvwFdBLAy&_nc_oc=AdlrITkf_gOQL5HUfx18TyZZo5s7isilkvQNyn-OcMQVx5h_5xE0uL-YXPjya5c3p4k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwEhwNOmU-EQh6vx3Pvqoooouwp2SkJdNcG8tiXj8v55w&oe=69B53E7F"}, "display_name": "Cellular Safari", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Safari Cellular** is an innovative virtual reality app that turns learning about **cellular biology** into an exciting adventure. Designed for **students, educators and science enthusiasts**, this app allows you to explore an **animal cell in 3D** like never before. Through an immersive interface, you can navigate through different cell structures, such as **the nucleus, mitochondria, and endoplasmic reticulum**, discovering their functions and importance.\n\nEach component of the cell is represented in stunning detail, allowing you to observe and understand complex biological processes in a visually engaging way. **Integrated artificial intelligence** is at your disposal to answer any questions you may have while exploring, providing clear and detailed explanations.\n\nCellular Safari is not just a passive educational experience; it includes a series of **mini interactive games** designed to consolidate your knowledge in a fun and engaging way. Through **challenges and quizzes**, you can test your understanding of biological concepts, making learning an active and stimulating process.\n\nPerfect for use in education or as a self-study tool, Cellular Safari offers a new and innovative way to explore the microscopic world of the animal cell. With **high-quality graphics** and an **intuitive user experience**, this app turns the study of biology into an unforgettable adventure.", "short_description": "Discover the fascinating world of the animal cell with Cell Safari, the educational VR app that allows you to explore cell structures in 3D. Through interactive mini-games and advanced artificial intelligence, learn scientific concepts while having fun. Ideal for students and biology enthusiasts, this immersive experience makes learning an exciting adventure."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape Mini.png", "id": "2930927027073306", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974477_2930927030406639_1033799740283778117_n.